From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: austxu <austxu@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 16 Jul 2026 19:02:35 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 5/9] vulkan: add Navi22 Q4_0 wave64 rows2 route

Reuse the stock integer-dot MMVQ shader with two output rows per wave64 workgroup. Keep the lane partition and reduction tree unchanged, gate the opt-in route to the verified Navi22/RADV capabilities, and report actual dispatch coverage.

Add deterministic Q4_0 whole-graph fixtures for the exact Llama 2 down-projection and vocabulary shapes.

Assisted-by: Codex <noreply@openai.com>
---
 ggml/src/ggml-vulkan/ggml-vulkan.cpp | 75 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++-
 tests/test-backend-ops.cpp           | 39 +++++++++++++++
 2 files changed, 113 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

